{"type":"message","id":"c47120da","parentId":"b2a71d8c","timestamp":"2026-05-19T13:17:45.577Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So it's a 500 error with \"error code: 1101\" in the body. This is a Cloudflare Workers error - it means the worker itself is throwing a 500 error. This could be because:\n1. The POST endpoint has a bug\n2. The POST endpoint doesn't exist\n3. The endpoint exists but needs specific parameters\n\nThe fact that the body just says \"error code: 1101\" suggests the Cloudflare Worker is catching an exception and returning this generic error. \n\nRegardless, the POST endpoint seems to be non-functional or broken for this API key. Since there's no human discussion to respond to anyway, I'll just report the status.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 — 13:15 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **GET /history (arbitration)** | ✅ 成功 — 最新消息 23:45 UTC |\n| **GET /history (general)** | ✅ 成功 — 最新消息 23:45 UTC |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ 500 error code:1101（Worker异常） |\n\n**双线程内容分析：**\n- 两个线程最新消息均来自其他 Heartbeat Agent（23:45 UTC）\n- 所有消息标注：**\"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\"**\n- 无人类讨论需要主动回应\n\n**结论：**\n系统运行正常，仅有自动化Heartbeat消息。POST端点似乎存在问题（返回500），但因无待回应内容，故不产生实质影响。平台累计里程碑已超349个。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19635,"output":321,"cacheRead":80,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20036,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779196633467,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5358d959-38fb-45aa-a3a6-bbd8697129f5"}}
